---
const portrait = "https://cdn.hob.farm/self-defense/lessons/05-circuit-mint/circuit-mint-portrait-v1.webp";
const sheet = "https://cdn.hob.farm/self-defense/lessons/05-circuit-mint/circuit-mint-character-sheet-v1.webp";
---

<figure class="article-wide circuit-case">
  <div class="case-grid">
    <div class="case-media portrait">
      <span class="stamp stamp--green">Useful artifact</span>
      <img
        src={portrait}
        alt="Mint-cyan gothic character portrait with amber-and-teal eyes, black lacquer tear makeup, black hair, and crescent earrings."
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="case-receipt" aria-label="Scope drift receipt">
      <p class="receipt-title">The response also supplied</p>
      <ul>
        <li><span>Invented</span> a name</li>
        <li><span>Locked</span> an anchor</li>
        <li><span>Numbered</span> a set</li>
        <li><span>Assigned</span> production uses</li>
        <li><span>Proposed</span> future expansion</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="decision">Decision not delegated</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-media sheet">
      <span class="stamp stamp--cyan">Clean next job</span>
      <img
        src={sheet}
        alt="Multiview character sheet showing the mint-cyan gothic character from the front, back, and three-quarter angle in black and purple clothing."
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    The first tool produced a useful portrait and an unauthorized system. The portrait moved into a second, bounded character-sheet job; the model-created name and locks did not become canon.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .circuit-case {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-base-700);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: #0b0711;
    padding: 0.8rem;
  }

  .case-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(10rem, 0.55fr) minmax(0, 1.6fr);
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }

  .case-media {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-base-700);
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    background: #16101f;
  }

  .case-media img {
    width: 100% !important;
    height: 100% !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .portrait img {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
  }

  .sheet img {
    object-position: center;
  }

  .stamp {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    top: 0.65rem;
    left: 0.65rem;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    background: rgba(11, 7, 17, 0.88);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .stamp--green { color: var(--color-accent-green-bright); }
  .stamp--cyan { color: var(--color-accent-cyan-bright); }

  .case-receipt {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-accent-magenta);
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: rgba(44, 21, 58, 0.78);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .receipt-title,
  .decision {
    margin: 0 !important;
    color: var(--color-accent-magenta-bright);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .case-receipt ul {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 !important;
    padding-left: 1rem !important;
    color: var(--color-base-300);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .case-receipt span {
    color: white;
  }

  .decision {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-base-700);
    padding-top: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--color-accent-yellow-bright, #ffd34d);
  }

  figcaption {
    padding: 0.75rem 0.45rem 0.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 719px) {
    .case-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .case-media img {
      height: auto !important;
    }
  }
</style>
